# Test calls. In VS Code, click "Send Request" above a call (needs the API running).
@api = http://localhost:5080

### All topics
GET {{api}}/api/topics
Accept: application/json

### One topic with its simulations
GET {{api}}/api/topics/newtons-first-law
Accept: application/json

### A topic that does not exist (404)
GET {{api}}/api/topics/nope
Accept: application/json

### All missions
GET {{api}}/api/entries?kind=Mission
Accept: application/json

### All mysteries
GET {{api}}/api/entries?kind=Mystery
Accept: application/json

### One entry with chapters and people
GET {{api}}/api/entries/apollo-11
Accept: application/json

### One person (the id comes from an entry's people list)
GET {{api}}/api/people/1
Accept: application/json

### Catalogue: search ignores capital letters
GET {{api}}/api/catalogue?search=SGR&page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

### Catalogue: filters
GET {{api}}/api/catalogue?type=BlackHole&constellation=sagittarius&minDistance=1000&maxDistance=30000
Accept: application/json

### Catalogue: a wrong page gives 400
GET {{api}}/api/catalogue?page=0
Accept: application/json

### Catalogue: values for the filter dropdowns
GET {{api}}/api/catalogue/filters
Accept: application/json

### One catalogue object
GET {{api}}/api/catalogue/sagittarius-a-star
Accept: application/json
